{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/minimumscalefactor"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The minimum permissible proportion to shrink the font size to fit the text into the available space."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumScaleFactor","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"set","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the example below, a label with a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/minimumScaleFactor","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" of 0.5 draws its text in a font size as small as half of the actual font if needed to fit into the space next to the text input field:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"HStack {"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Text(“This is a very long label:”)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":".lineLimit(1)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":".minimumScaleFactor(0.5)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TextField(“My Long Text Field”, text: $myTextField)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":".frame(width: 250, height: 50, alignment: .center)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"}"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":